From e032a64646cf2b190a8bec1a7584eea5ebaee29f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 15:43:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] test(test-quality): resolve slice import preambles through
 the shared loaders

Replaces bespoke _load_module helpers, spec_from_file_location blocks and
Path(__file__).parent chains across ten modules in the configuration and
manifest slice with conftest.load_script_module / get_script_path /
add_skill_scripts_to_path / PROJECT_ROOT.

Every converted call preserves its original sys.modules registration name.
The marketplace config modules carry mutable module-level default dicts, so
collapsing distinct registration names onto a shared one makes tests
order-dependent.

Also removes a dead _REPO_ROOT in test_derive_verification_outcomes.py.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
